orbit (0.17.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  This package now builds the Rust implementation of Orbit.

  /etc/orbit/orbit.conf and the History are incompatible.

 -- Blake Lee <blake@volian.org>  Wed, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 -0500

orbit (0.15.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  Orbit hooks have been removed. You should use apt hooks.

 -- Blake Lee <blake@volian.org>  Tue, 23 Jan 2024 23:37:08 -0600

orbit (0.9.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  The configuration file for Orbit at `/etc/orbit/orbit.conf`
  has been changed to toml. This change is BREAKING as the older config
  file will no longer work. Orbit will still run with the old config,
  but there will be a syntax error and it will use the program defaults.

 -- Blake Lee <blake@volian.org>  Mon, 23 May 2022 15:53:49 -0400
